    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "27b62329-cebe-5d43-be47-1113e40c3132",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\csc x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The domain is all real numbers except integer multiples of $\\pi$.\n- **II.** The range is $(-\\infty,-1]\\cup[1,\\infty)$.\n- **III.** The graph intersects the $y$-axis.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "5b25d3c1-93ef-5287-840e-9c67a3159ec4",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "a9cacc89-5001-590a-8eb4-7103c0a5dbdb",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "3e2869ca-9cf1-5b5b-9c43-70231dde4713",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "3e2869ca-9cf1-5b5b-9c43-70231dde4713"
          ]
        },
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "9a2ed4f7-4a86-5fe6-9836-773d6e3ccff0",
          ":answer-field/key": "II",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "54250525-0c2f-5488-96ff-77f2052de157",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "c77ddba3-3e5b-53c7-8355-773c71d21fff",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "c77ddba3-3e5b-53c7-8355-773c71d21fff"
          ]
        },
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "dfa3b9f1-4346-57c9-a538-964fb950db06",
          ":answer-field/key": "III",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "34b70ee0-219d-503c-b208-80206fbbb997",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "45c33aad-02b1-5918-b691-d3dd4a6383f1",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "34b70ee0-219d-503c-b208-80206fbbb997"
          ]
        }
      ],
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\csc x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The function's domain is all real numbers except the integer multiples of $\\pi$. Hence, statement I is true.\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\infty,-1]\\cup[1,\\infty)$.  Hence, statement II is true.\n\n- The graph does not intersect the $y$-axis, as $x=0$ is not in the domain. Hence, statement III is false.",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy"
    },
